CA intermediates that agencies' servers leave out of their certificate
chains. `taxability fetch` and `ingest --kind taxability` add these to the
trusted set for their own process only, so the pages load without turning
certificate checks off. Each is a public intermediate issued by a root Node
already trusts; check one with
  openssl x509 -in intermediates.pem -noout -subject -issuer -fingerprint -sha256

